description: No unrequested git attribution trailers
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commit messages

Use a plain `-m` or `-F` commit message. Do not add unrequested
attribution trailers (`Co-authored-by`, `Signed-off-by`, Generated-by,
or `git commit --trailer`) unless the user asks.

This repo's `.cursor/rules/git-user-commits.mdc` is an explicit
exception: after substantive work, include
`Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`.
